  "corrections_offered": [
    "docs/MISSION_SCENE_CONTENTS.md names the 28h list element AvoidZone from the literal at 00CE38AC. The class name the writer 0041EF90 emits, and that every shipped .nav carries, is TerrainGridLayer (00CE38D0); the container's name is TerrainGrid.",
    "The same doc says the .nav and .ema files are not present loose in the installation. 253 loose .nav files exist under universe/scenes/**; the grammar derived here parses every one to the exact file length.",
